# Plan a path to a pose. Exists so that a planning failure is reported rather than silent.
#
# use_start selects between planning from start and planning from the robot's current pose; start is
# ignored when it is false.

# Goal
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped goal
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped start
bool use_start
---
# Result
# outcome uses the OUTCOME_* constants of eltanin_msgs/NavigationState. Values a planner cannot
# produce, such as OUTCOME_STALLED, simply never appear; the value set is shared so that the
# conversion from NavigateOutcome stays a single function.
nav_msgs/Path path
uint8 outcome
string message
---
# Feedback
# Empty: planning here is a single call with no intermediate progress to report. A field is added
# when there is something to put in it.
